 "words": 226,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "She stood alone in the dust and sand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The crowd had gone, leaving her in hand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus straightened up to see her face",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the quiet place where silence traces",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where are those who threw stones in the air",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Has no one found a reason to spare",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She looked down low, trembling with fear",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Knowing that the end was near",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the light of the world",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever follows me is not unfurled",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Never walk in the darkness deep",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But hold the light of life in your sleep",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They said your own words are not true",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You testify only of you alone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I know where I came from and where I go",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You do not know the way to know",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You judge by the standards of men",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I judge not, for I am not in",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your human measure is blind and small",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the truth that stands tall",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the light of the world",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever follows me is not unfurled",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Never walk in the darkness deep",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But hold the light of life in your sleep",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Neither do I condemn you now",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Go from this place, make the light your vow",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sin no more, turn from the old way",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Walk in the day, let the shadows fade away",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the light of the world",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The light of life, the light of the world",
   "heard": 9,
